      {
        "id": "36:2",
        "name": "UXPert is a Figma plugin that automates UI/UX design critique using heuristic algorithms built on TensorFlow and PyTorch. It tackles the challenges of slow, biased manual evaluations by quickly identifying usability flaws like system status visibility and error prevention. By streamlining the review process, UXPert helps designers create high-quality, user-centered interfaces more efficiently.",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "textContent": "UXPert is a Figma plugin that automates UI/UX design critique using heuristic algorithms built on TensorFlow and PyTorch. It tackles the challenges of slow, biased manual evaluations by quickly identifying usability flaws like system status visibility and error prevention. By streamlining the review process, UXPert helps designers create high-quality, user-centered interfaces more efficiently.",
        "width": 44,
        "height": 20,
        "position.x": 7,
        "position.y": 47,
        "rotation": 0,
        "color_r": 0,
        "color_g": 0,
        "color_b": 0,
        "hasClickInteraction": false,
        "clickDestination": "None",
        "isIconLabeled": null
      },
      {
        "id": "41:41",
        "name": "Streamline the exhausting manual review process by providing a Figma plugin that automates the design feedback. Develop an intelligent Figma plugin that provides automated real-time feedback based on UX principles. Implement a feature that offers improved suggestions to the designers, and based on their choice, it will automatically be applied to the Figma design. Include UX heuristic rules to ensure that the provided feedback promotes user-centered and intuitive design. Reduce designers\u2019 efforts and time in the reviewing process so that designers may concentrate on creativity and innovation rather than manual evaluation.",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "textContent": "Streamline the exhausting manual review process by providing a Figma plugin that automates the design feedback.\nDevelop an intelligent Figma plugin that provides automated real-time feedback based on UX principles.\nImplement a feature that offers improved suggestions to the designers, and based on their choice, it will automatically be applied to the Figma design.\nInclude UX heuristic rules to ensure that the provided feedback promotes user-centered and intuitive design.\nReduce designers\u2019 efforts and time in the reviewing process so that designers may concentrate on creativity and innovation rather than manual evaluation.",
        "width": 46,
        "height": 27,
        "position.x": 5,
        "position.y": 122,
        "rotation": 0,
        "color_r": 0,
        "color_g": 0,
        "color_b": 0,
        "hasClickInteraction": false,
        "clickDestination": "None",
        "isIconLabeled": null
      },
      {
        "id": "43:3",
        "name": "Great design depends on clear, user-centered communication\u2014but many interfaces fall short. Our Figma plugin provides instant feedback based on the 10 Nielsen Heuristics, helping designers spot and fix usability issues early. Seamlessly integrated into Figma, our tool empowers faster, smarter design decisions, leading to better user experiences. We're here to make intuitive design the standard, starting with every project.",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "textContent": "Great design depends on clear, user-centered communication\u2014but many interfaces fall short. Our Figma plugin provides instant feedback based on the 10 Nielsen Heuristics, helping designers spot and fix usability issues early. Seamlessly integrated into Figma, our tool empowers faster, smarter design decisions, leading to better user experiences. We're here to make intuitive design the standard, starting with every project.",
        "width": 44,
        "height": 23,
        "position.x": 59,
        "position.y": 47,
        "rotation": 0,
        "color_r": 0,
        "color_g": 0,
        "color_b": 0,
        "hasClickInteraction": false,
        "clickDestination": "None",
        "isIconLabeled": null
      },
      {
        "id": "65:87",
        "name": "Component-Based Architecture: Modular, scalable system design. Machine Learning: Rico, MASC, EGFE-trained models for clustering, pattern recognition. Heuristic Evaluation: Nielsen\u2019s heuristics, Gestalt principles for UX compliance. GPT-4o Suggestions: Context-aware, actionable design recommendations. Figma API Integration: Real-time design extraction, modification. User-Centered Interface: Clear feedback, scoring system, feedback loops. Continuous Learning: Adapts to new UX trends.",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "textContent": "Component-Based Architecture: Modular, scalable system design.\r\n\nMachine Learning: Rico, MASC, EGFE-trained models for clustering, pattern recognition.\r\n\nHeuristic Evaluation: Nielsen\u2019s heuristics, Gestalt principles for UX compliance.\r\n\nGPT-4o Suggestions: Context-aware, actionable design recommendations.\r\n\nFigma API Integration: Real-time design extraction, modification.\r\n\nUser-Centered Interface: Clear feedback, scoring system, feedback loops.\r\n\nContinuous Learning: Adapts to new UX trends.\r",
        "width": 96,
        "height": 25,
        "position.x": 7,
        "position.y": 84,
        "rotation": 0,
        "color_r": 0,
        "color_g": 0,
