      {
        "id": "48:2",
        "name": "Feature Extraction & Preprocessing Essential UI features such as layout, positioning, and color were extracted and normalized to ensure consistency and improve evaluation accuracy. Clustering Analysis DBSCAN was applied to group similar design features. Clustering quality was measured using Silhouette Score and Davies-Bouldin Index. Feedback Generation Heuristic-based evaluation was implemented to provide instant feedback on each design frame. Suggestion Generation GPT-4o API was integrated to generate refined design suggestions aligned with UX principles.",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "textContent": "Feature Extraction & Preprocessing\nEssential UI features such as layout, positioning, and color were extracted and normalized to ensure consistency and improve evaluation accuracy.\nClustering Analysis\nDBSCAN was applied to group similar design features. Clustering quality was measured using Silhouette Score and Davies-Bouldin Index.\nFeedback Generation\nHeuristic-based evaluation was implemented to provide instant feedback on each design frame.\nSuggestion Generation\nGPT-4o API was integrated to generate refined design suggestions aligned with UX principles.",
